public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-09T02:00:44Z","updated_at":"2026-09-09T02:00:44Z","body":"I was able to reproduce the issue creating a scene with a child node, saving this scene and instancing into another scene:\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1e6345da-fdeb-470f-a515-51c29c35cd0c\n\n[transform-bug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/31985355/transform-bug.zip)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5594625557/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5605264779","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121455#issuecomment-5605264779","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121455","id":5605264779,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABThmNiw","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-09T16:30:12Z","updated_at":"2026-09-09T16:30:38Z","body":"I can confirm this on 4.8.dev 9552dfb68 (Linux) on @matheusmdx's MRP.\n\nThis depends on whether **Editable Children** is enabled on the instanced scene. The issue only occurs if it's disabled, as the modified value of the child can't be persisted to the scene file. If you enable it, the property can be persisted so it'll stay as expected after reloading the scene.\n\nWe should probably prevent the use of this feature on instanced scenes with Editable Children disabled (and show a message telling you to enable Editable Children in the bottom-left corner).","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5605264779/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5616924351","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121455#issuecomment-5616924351","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121455","id":5616924351,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABTst2vw","user":{"login":"Nodragem","id":10520249,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNTIwMjQ5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10520249?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem","html_url":"https://github.com/Nodragem","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-10T10:12:02Z","updated_at":"2026-09-10T10:14:41Z","body":"[preserve-transform-children.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/32053370/preserve-transform-children.zip)\n\nHere is a MRP similar to the one posted above, but this time, a capsule mesh is the child of a instantiated scene. I would think that the expected behaviour when moving the instantiated scene with Preserve Children Transform is to move the instantiated scene as if it was made of one node, and preserve the local child transform.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1db3a586-4540-43ce-9456-53d46ad84c4a\n\n> We should probably prevent the use of this feature on instanced scenes with Editable Children disabled (and show a message telling you to enable Editable Children in the bottom-left corner).\n\nConsidering that the default is that Editable Children is OFF, I think it would be more practical if instanced scenes behaved as if they were made of one node except if Editable Children is turned ON. Meaning that if you move a instanced scene with Preserve Children Transform enabled, the whole instanced scene moves as if it was one node. That behaviour would also make sense in the scenario explained in the paragraph just above.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5616924351/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]